<body>
<div type="letter">
<pb facs="1038556" n="169r"/>
  <p><lb/>Ex iis, quas heri accepi <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> <abbr>D.</abbr> Nepote tuo <rs type="person">Antonio</rs>, <rs type="lostletter">litteris</rs> Te bene va<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>lere l<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>tus intellexi; ego per gratiam Divinam quoque bona valetu<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>dine utor. Pergrata mihi fuit<del><del><gap/></del></del> co<choice><orig><g ref="#mm">&#xE5D2;</g></orig><reg>mm</reg></choice>endatio <rs type="person">Juvenis</rs> illius
      <lb/><rs type="place" key="place_KON-deutsch">Germani</rs>, qui huc venturus est pro accipienda laurea in utroque
      <lb/>jure; si qua in re ipsi utilis esse potero, lubens faciam. Hac occa<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>sione Te rogo, ut mihi mittas<del>,</del> per <rs type="person">juvenem</rs> istum, si nondum <rs type="place" key="place_VER-repven">Ve<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>netiis</rs> profectus est, volumina illa qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> habes <rs type="keyword">Transactionum
      <lb/>Anglicarum</rs>, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> proxime remittam. Hodie mane <rs type="person">Giaco<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>mettus</rs> noster, quem ad sanam mentem rediturum non puta<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>bant, Oratione eleganti Professionem suam auspicatus est,
      <lb/>superavitque omnium quasi expectationem. Nuper misi ad
      <lb/><abbr>Dnum</abbr> <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-117596027">Zendrinum</rs> <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_TAESSVJE">Solutionem</rs> meam <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_65T3BHVK">Problematis</rs> <add>olim</add> <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> me
      <lb/>propositi, ut eam<del>Italice factam</del> in sermonem vestrum trans<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc>
<pb facs="1038557" n="169v"/>
      <lb break="no"/>latam <rs type="keyword">Diario</rs> inserendam curaret, quam si videre cupias
      <lb/>Tecum co<choice><orig><g ref="#mm">&#xE5D2;</g></orig><reg>mm</reg></choice>unicabit.</p> <closer><salute>Vale et me ut facis, amare perge.</salute>
      <lb/><dateline><rs type="place" key="place_GEO-3171728">Patavii</rs> <abbr>d.</abbr> <date when="1719-03-16">16. Martii 1719.</date></dateline></closer>
  <postscript><p><abbr>P. S.</abbr> Saluto plurimum <abbr>D.<hi rend="sup">um</hi></abbr>
        <lb/><rs type="person">Antonium</rs>, cui pro <rs type="lostletter">epistola</rs> sua maximas gratias ago.</p></postscript>
</div>
</body>
